{"id":"wb-7-711","name":"慈寿寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"慈寿寺塔","text":"慈寿寺塔，原名永安万寿塔，俗称八里庄塔，又名玲珑塔，位于中华人民共和国北京市海淀区八里庄，是一座八角十三层的密檐式实心砖塔。该塔始建于明朝万历年间，是慈寿寺的附属建筑，曾于清乾隆年间修缮，光绪年间寺庙被焚毁，而塔保留了下来。该塔先后于1957年和2013年被列为北京市文物保护单位和全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%85%88%E5%AF%BF%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":92204942,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92204942","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e6396ab0548db0470ebd1158.jpg","title":"慈寿寺塔国保碑.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%85%88%E5%AF%BF%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/%E6%85%88%E5%AF%BF%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Cishousi Pagoda","width":320,"height":225,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata P373 专属相册：Pagoda of Cishou Temple","categorySourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Pagoda_of_Cishou_Temple"}}